{"id": "libritts_r_1284_1180_000004_000004", "audio": "audio/libritts_r/1284_1180_000004_000004.wav", "text": "Instead of shoes, the old man wore boots with turnover tops and his blue coat had wide cuffs of gold braid.", "language": "en_us", "event": "speech", "speaker": "libritts_r:1284", "source": "libritts_r:1284_1180", "split": "train", "license": "CC-BY-4.0", "provenance": "https://www.openslr.org/141/ (via https://huggingface.co/datasets/mythicinfinity/libritts_r data/test.clean) test-clean/1284/1180/1284_1180_000004_000004.wav", "ref_audio": "audio/libritts_r/1284_1181_000003_000001.wav"}
{"id": "libritts_r_1284_1180_000006_000002", "audio": "audio/libritts_r/1284_1180_000006_000002.wav", "text": "For a long time he had wished to explore the beautiful Land of Oz in which they lived.", "language": "en_us", "event": "speech", "speaker": "libritts_r:1284", "source": "libritts_r:1284_1180", "split": "train", "license": "CC-BY-4.0", "provenance": "https://www.openslr.org/141/ (via https://huggingface.co/datasets/mythicinfinity/libritts_r data/test.clean) test-clean/1284/1180/1284_1180_000006_000002.wav", "ref_audio": "audio/libritts_r/1284_1181_000003_000001.wav"}
{"id": "libritts_r_3575_170457_000010_000001", "audio": "audio/libritts_r/3575_170457_000010_000001.wav", "text": "How long are we likely to be separated? Why are we to be denied each other's society?", "language": "en_us", "event": "speech", "speaker": "libritts_r:3575", "source": "libritts_r:3575_170457", "split": "train", "license": "CC-BY-4.0", "provenance": "https://www.openslr.org/141/ (via https://huggingface.co/datasets/mythicinfinity/libritts_r data/test.clean) test-clean/3575/170457/3575_170457_000010_000001.wav", "ref_audio": "audio/libritts_r/3575_170457_000010_000004.wav"}
{"id": "libritts_r_3575_170457_000010_000007", "audio": "audio/libritts_r/3575_170457_000010_000007.wav", "text": "At first, I could not say 'Thy will be done!' I felt rebellious, but I knew it was wrong to feel so.", "language": "en_us", "event": "speech", "speaker": "libritts_r:3575", "source": "libritts_r:3575_170457", "split": "train", "license": "CC-BY-4.0", "provenance": "https://www.openslr.org/141/ (via https://huggingface.co/datasets/mythicinfinity/libritts_r data/test.clean) test-clean/3575/170457/3575_170457_000010_000007.wav", "ref_audio": "audio/libritts_r/3575_170457_000010_000004.wav"}
{"id": "libritts_r_3729_6852_000003_000001", "audio": "audio/libritts_r/3729_6852_000003_000001.wav", "text": "Baletti's father, who had just recovered from a long illness, was not with us, but we had his father's sister, who was older than Mario.", "language": "en_us", "event": "speech", "speaker": "libritts_r:3729", "source": "libritts_r:3729_6852", "split": "train", "license": "CC-BY-4.0", "provenance": "https://www.openslr.org/141/ (via https://huggingface.co/datasets/mythicinfinity/libritts_r data/test.clean) test-clean/3729/6852/3729_6852_000003_000001.wav", "ref_audio": "audio/libritts_r/3729_6852_000004_000003.wav"}
{"id": "libritts_r_3729_6852_000003_000004", "audio": "audio/libritts_r/3729_6852_000003_000004.wav", "text": "Martelli composed a satire against Maffei, in which he designated him by the anagram of Femia.", "language": "en_us", "event": "speech", "speaker": "libritts_r:3729", "source": "libritts_r:3729_6852", "split": "train", "license": "CC-BY-4.0", "provenance": "https://www.openslr.org/141/ (via https://huggingface.co/datasets/mythicinfinity/libritts_r data/test.clean) test-clean/3729/6852/3729_6852_000003_000004.wav", "ref_audio": "audio/libritts_r/3729_6852_000004_000003.wav"}
{"id": "libritts_r_5683_32865_000005_000002", "audio": "audio/libritts_r/5683_32865_000005_000002.wav", "text": "I often thought since that he had expected to see Wylder before him.", "language": "en_us", "event": "speech", "speaker": "libritts_r:5683", "source": "libritts_r:5683_32865", "split": "heldout", "license": "CC-BY-4.0", "provenance": "https://www.openslr.org/141/ (via https://huggingface.co/datasets/mythicinfinity/libritts_r data/test.clean) test-clean/5683/32865/5683_32865_000005_000002.wav", "ref_audio": "audio/libritts_r/5683_32865_000005_000001.wav"}
{"id": "libritts_r_5683_32865_000008_000002", "audio": "audio/libritts_r/5683_32865_000008_000002.wav", "text": "My mother could tell us all about it-we, Brandons, Lakes; Wylders, and Chelfords.'", "language": "en_us", "event": "speech", "speaker": "libritts_r:5683", "source": "libritts_r:5683_32865", "split": "heldout", "license": "CC-BY-4.0", "provenance": "https://www.openslr.org/141/ (via https://huggingface.co/datasets/mythicinfinity/libritts_r data/test.clean) test-clean/5683/32865/5683_32865_000008_000002.wav", "ref_audio": "audio/libritts_r/5683_32865_000005_000001.wav"}
{"id": "libritts_r_7127_75947_000006_000007", "audio": "audio/libritts_r/7127_75947_000006_000007.wav", "text": "All these sufferings, successes, and remarks were blended, confounded, and lost in the uproar of applause.", "language": "en_us", "event": "speech", "speaker": "libritts_r:7127", "source": "libritts_r:7127_75947", "split": "train", "license": "CC-BY-4.0", "provenance": "https://www.openslr.org/141/ (via https://huggingface.co/datasets/mythicinfinity/libritts_r data/test.clean) test-clean/7127/75947/7127_75947_000006_000007.wav", "ref_audio": "audio/libritts_r/7127_75947_000007_000000.wav"}
{"id": "libritts_r_7127_75947_000006_000009", "audio": "audio/libritts_r/7127_75947_000006_000009.wav", "text": "De Guiche, observing that she was alone, near a thicket constructed of painted cloth, approached her.", "language": "en_us", "event": "speech", "speaker": "libritts_r:7127", "source": "libritts_r:7127_75947", "split": "train", "license": "CC-BY-4.0", "provenance": "https://www.openslr.org/141/ (via https://huggingface.co/datasets/mythicinfinity/libritts_r data/test.clean) test-clean/7127/75947/7127_75947_000006_000009.wav", "ref_audio": "audio/libritts_r/7127_75947_000007_000000.wav"}
{"id": "libritts_r_7729_102255_000002_000001", "audio": "audio/libritts_r/7729_102255_000002_000001.wav", "text": "The bogus Legislature numbered thirty six members.", "language": "en_us", "event": "speech", "speaker": "libritts_r:7729", "source": "libritts_r:7729_102255", "split": "train", "license": "CC-BY-4.0", "provenance": "https://www.openslr.org/141/ (via https://huggingface.co/datasets/mythicinfinity/libritts_r data/test.clean) test-clean/7729/102255/7729_102255_000002_000001.wav", "ref_audio": "audio/libritts_r/7729_102255_000002_000005.wav"}
{"id": "libritts_r_7729_102255_000002_000003", "audio": "audio/libritts_r/7729_102255_000002_000003.wav", "text": "This was at the March election, eighteen fifty five.", "language": "en_us", "event": "speech", "speaker": "libritts_r:7729", "source": "libritts_r:7729_102255", "split": "train", "license": "CC-BY-4.0", "provenance": "https://www.openslr.org/141/ (via https://huggingface.co/datasets/mythicinfinity/libritts_r data/test.clean) test-clean/7729/102255/7729_102255_000002_000003.wav", "ref_audio": "audio/libritts_r/7729_102255_000002_000005.wav"}
{"id": "libritts_r_8224_274384_000000_000001", "audio": "audio/libritts_r/8224_274384_000000_000001.wav", "text": "He rode before a portmanteau, and called himself Ashburnham's servant.", "language": "en_us", "event": "speech", "speaker": "libritts_r:8224", "source": "libritts_r:8224_274384", "split": "train", "license": "CC-BY-4.0", "provenance": "https://www.openslr.org/141/ (via https://huggingface.co/datasets/mythicinfinity/libritts_r data/test.clean) test-clean/8224/274384/8224_274384_000000_000001.wav", "ref_audio": "audio/libritts_r/8224_274384_000001_000001.wav"}
{"id": "libritts_r_8224_274384_000005_000001", "audio": "audio/libritts_r/8224_274384_000005_000001.wav", "text": "He was particularly attentive to the behavior of their preachers, on whom all depended.", "language": "en_us", "event": "speech", "speaker": "libritts_r:8224", "source": "libritts_r:8224_274384", "split": "train", "license": "CC-BY-4.0", "provenance": "https://www.openslr.org/141/ (via https://huggingface.co/datasets/mythicinfinity/libritts_r data/test.clean) test-clean/8224/274384/8224_274384_000005_000001.wav", "ref_audio": "audio/libritts_r/8224_274384_000001_000001.wav"}
{"id": "libritts_r_8230_279154_000002_000000", "audio": "audio/libritts_r/8230_279154_000002_000000.wav", "text": "Memory, which we are to consider to day, introduces us to knowledge in one of its forms.", "language": "en_us", "event": "speech", "speaker": "libritts_r:8230", "source": "libritts_r:8230_279154", "split": "heldout", "license": "CC-BY-4.0", "provenance": "https://www.openslr.org/141/ (via https://huggingface.co/datasets/mythicinfinity/libritts_r data/test.clean) test-clean/8230/279154/8230_279154_000002_000000.wav", "ref_audio": "audio/libritts_r/8230_279154_000006_000001.wav"}
{"id": "libritts_r_8230_279154_000008_000001", "audio": "audio/libritts_r/8230_279154_000008_000001.wav", "text": "The behaviourist, who attempts to make psychology a record of behaviour, has to trust his memory in making the record.", "language": "en_us", "event": "speech", "speaker": "libritts_r:8230", "source": "libritts_r:8230_279154", "split": "heldout", "license": "CC-BY-4.0", "provenance": "https://www.openslr.org/141/ (via https://huggingface.co/datasets/mythicinfinity/libritts_r data/test.clean) test-clean/8230/279154/8230_279154_000008_000001.wav", "ref_audio": "audio/libritts_r/8230_279154_000006_000001.wav"}
{"id": "libritts_r_8455_210777_000002_000002", "audio": "audio/libritts_r/8455_210777_000002_000002.wav", "text": "I wept to think that a spirit of honesty should as yet have prevailed so little in the world.", "language": "en_us", "event": "speech", "speaker": "libritts_r:8455", "source": "libritts_r:8455_210777", "split": "train", "license": "CC-BY-4.0", "provenance": "https://www.openslr.org/141/ (via https://huggingface.co/datasets/mythicinfinity/libritts_r data/test.clean) test-clean/8455/210777/8455_210777_000002_000002.wav", "ref_audio": "audio/libritts_r/8455_210777_000008_000002.wav"}
{"id": "libritts_r_8455_210777_000003_000004", "audio": "audio/libritts_r/8455_210777_000003_000004.wav", "text": "And what hope had there been, what reasonable expectation, that the system should have been allowed fair play?", "language": "en_us", "event": "speech", "speaker": "libritts_r:8455", "source": "libritts_r:8455_210777", "split": "train", "license": "CC-BY-4.0", "provenance": "https://www.openslr.org/141/ (via https://huggingface.co/datasets/mythicinfinity/libritts_r data/test.clean) test-clean/8455/210777/8455_210777_000003_000004.wav", "ref_audio": "audio/libritts_r/8455_210777_000008_000002.wav"}
{"id": "libritts_r_8555_284449_000007_000000", "audio": "audio/libritts_r/8555_284449_000007_000000.wav", "text": "In this order they proceeded to the main gate, which Trot ordered the guards to throw wide open.", "language": "en_us", "event": "speech", "speaker": "libritts_r:8555", "source": "libritts_r:8555_284449", "split": "train", "license": "CC-BY-4.0", "provenance": "https://www.openslr.org/141/ (via https://huggingface.co/datasets/mythicinfinity/libritts_r data/test.clean) test-clean/8555/284449/8555_284449_000007_000000.wav", "ref_audio": "audio/libritts_r/8555_284449_000009_000000.wav"}
{"id": "libritts_r_8555_284449_000007_000001", "audio": "audio/libritts_r/8555_284449_000007_000001.wav", "text": "Then they all marched out a little way into the fields and found that the Army of Pinkies had already formed and was advancing steadily toward them.", "language": "en_us", "event": "speech", "speaker": "libritts_r:8555", "source": "libritts_r:8555_284449", "split": "train", "license": "CC-BY-4.0", "provenance": "https://www.openslr.org/141/ (via https://huggingface.co/datasets/mythicinfinity/libritts_r data/test.clean) test-clean/8555/284449/8555_284449_000007_000001.wav", "ref_audio": "audio/libritts_r/8555_284449_000009_000000.wav"}
